{"seq":8,"slug":"lc0312-burst-balloons","title":"LeetCode 312 戳气球","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-dp-advanced/lc0312-burst-balloons","wordCount":803,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-312-戳气球\">LeetCode 312 戳气球</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>有 <code>n</code> 个气球，编号为 <code>0</code> 到 <code>n-1</code>，每个气球上都标有一个数字，存在数组 <code>nums</code> 中。现在要求你戳破所有的气球。戳破第 <code>i</code> 个气球，可以获得 <code>nums[i-1] × nums[i] × nums[i+1]</code> 枚硬币。这里的 <code>i-1</code> 和 <code>i+1</code> 代表和 <code>i</code> 相邻的两个气球的序号。如果 <code>i-1</code> 或 <code>i+1</code> 超出了数组的边界，那么就当它是一个数字为 <code>1</code> 的气球。</p>\n<p>求所能获得硬币的<strong>最大数量</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>n == nums.length</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= n &lt;= 300</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 100</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [3,1,5,8]&#10;输出：167&#10;解释：&#10;nums = [3,1,5,8] → [3,5,8] → [3,8] → [8] → []&#10;硬币 = 3×1×5 + 3×5×8 + 1×3×8 + 1×8×1 = 15+120+24+8 = 167\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [3,1,5,8]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：167</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>nums = [3,1,5,8] → [3,5,8] → [3,8] → [8] → []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>硬币 = 3×1×5 + 3×5×8 + 1×3×8 + 1×8×1 = 15+120+24+8 = 167</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [1,5]&#10;输出：10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [1,5]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：10</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题是<strong>区间 DP</strong> 的经典代表题目。关键难点在于：戳破一个气球后，它的邻居会发生变化，导致正向思考非常复杂。</p>\n<p><strong>逆向思维：</strong> 不要考虑先戳哪个气球，而是考虑<strong>最后戳哪个气球</strong>。在区间 <code>(i, j)</code> 内，假设最后戳破的是气球 <code>k</code>。此时 <code>k</code> 的左右邻居恰好是 <code>i</code> 和 <code>j</code>（区间内其他气球都已被戳破），因此获得的硬币为 <code>nums[i] × nums[k] × nums[j]</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>状态定义：</strong> 为了处理边界，在 <code>nums</code> 前后各添加一个值为 1 的虚拟气球。设 <code>dp[i][j]</code> 表示戳破开区间 <code>(i, j)</code> 内所有气球能获得的最大硬币数。</p>\n<p><strong>状态转移：</strong> 枚举最后戳破的气球 <code>k</code>（i &lt; k &lt; j）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"dp[i][j] = max(dp[i][k] + dp[k][j] + nums[i] × nums[k] × nums[j])  对所有 i &lt; k &lt; j\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>dp[i][j] = max(dp[i][k] + dp[k][j] + nums[i] × nums[k] × nums[j])  对所有 i &#x3C; k &#x3C; j</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解读：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>dp[i][k]</code>：戳破 <code>(i, k)</code> 内的气球获得的最大硬币</li>\n<li><code>dp[k][j]</code>：戳破 <code>(k, j)</code> 内的气球获得的最大硬币</li>\n<li><code>nums[i] × nums[k] × nums[j]</code>：最后戳破 <code>k</code> 获得的硬币</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[区间 DP: dp[i][j]&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;枚举最后戳破的 k&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[左半: dp[i][k]&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[右半: dp[k][j]&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[最后戳 k: nums[i]*nums[k]*nums[j]&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[dp[i][j] = max(dp[i][k]+dp[k][j]+nums[i]*nums[k]*nums[j])&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[区间 DP: dp[i][j]\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"枚举最后戳破的 k\"]\n    B --&gt; C[左半: dp[i][k]\"]\n    B --&gt; D[右半: dp[k][j]\"]\n    B --&gt; E[最后戳 k: nums[i]*nums[k]*nums[j]\"]\n    C --&gt; F[dp[i][j] = max(dp[i][k]+dp[k][j]+nums[i]*nums[k]*nums[j])\"]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F</pre><p><strong>遍历顺序：</strong> 区间长度从小到大（先算短区间，再算长区间）。这保证了计算 <code>dp[i][j]</code> 时，所有更短的区间已经计算完毕。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>区间 DP（自底向上）</td>\n<td>O(n³)</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>标准解法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记忆化递归</td>\n<td>O(n³)</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>自顶向下，逻辑相同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暴力全排列</td>\n<td>O(n!)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>超时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>区间 DP（自底向上）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function maxCoins(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  const n = nums.length;&#10;  const val = [1, ...nums, 1];&#10;  const dp: number[][] = Array.from({ length: n + 2 }, () =&gt; new Array(n + 2).fill(0));&#10;&#10;  for (let len = 2; len &lt;= n + 1; len++) {&#10;    for (let i = 0; i + len &lt;= n + 1; i++) {&#10;      const j = i + len;&#10;      for (let k = i + 1; k &lt; j; k++) {&#10;        dp[i][j] = Math.max(dp[i][j], dp[i][k] + dp[k][j] + val[i] * val[k] * val[j]);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dp[0][n + 1];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxCoins</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">nums, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; len</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j; k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dp[i][j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dp[i][j], dp[i][k] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[k][j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val[k] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val[j]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>记忆化递归：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function maxCoinsMemo(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  const n = nums.length;&#10;  const val = [1, ...nums, 1];&#10;  const memo: number[][] = Array.from({ length: n + 2 }, () =&gt; new Array(n + 2).fill(-1));&#10;&#10;  const solve = (i: number, j: number): number =&gt; {&#10;    if (j - i &lt; 2) return 0;&#10;    if (memo[i][j] !== -1) return memo[i][j];&#10;&#10;    let best = 0;&#10;    for (let k = i + 1; k &lt; j; k++) {&#10;      best = Math.max(best, solve(i, k) + solve(k, j) + val[i] * val[k] * val[j]);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    memo[i][j] = best;&#10;    return best;&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  return solve(0, n + 1);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxCoinsMemo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">nums, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> memo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> solve</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;-