0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j; k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      best </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(best, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">solve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i, k) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> solve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k, j) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val[k] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val[j]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    memo[i][j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> solve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>逆向思维的精髓：</strong></p>\n<p>为什么要考虑&quot;最后戳破&quot;而非&quot;最先戳破&quot;？因为最先戳破某个气球后，它的邻居会合并，后续的状态非常难以描述。而&quot;最后戳破&quot;的好处是：在开区间 <code>(i, j)</code> 中最后戳破 <code>k</code> 时，<code>k</code> 的邻居确定为 <code>i</code> 和 <code>j</code>（两端未被戳破的边界气球），状态转移变得清晰。</p>\n<p>这种&quot;逆向思考&quot;的技巧在区间 DP 中非常常见。类似的思路还出现在矩阵链乘法、石子合并等经典问题中。</p>\n<p><strong>示例演算（nums = [3,1,5,8]，扩展为 val = [1,3,1,5,8,1]）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"dp[0][2] = 1×3×1 = 3         (只有气球 3)&#10;dp[1][3] = 3×1×5 = 15        (只有气球 1)&#10;dp[2][4] = 1×5×8 = 40        (只有气球 5)&#10;dp[3][5] = 5×8×1 = 40        (只有气球 8)&#10;dp[0][3] = max(dp[0][1]+dp[1][3]+1×3×5, dp[0][2]+dp[2][3]+1×1×5)&#10;         = max(0+15+15, 3+0+5) = 30&#10;...最终 dp[0][5] = 167\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>dp[0][2] = 1×3×1 = 3         (只有气球 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dp[1][3] = 3×1×5 = 15        (只有气球 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dp[2][4] = 1×5×8 = 40        (只有气球 5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dp[3][5] = 5×8×1 = 40        (只有气球 8)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dp[0][3] = max(dp[0][1]+dp[1][3]+1×3×5, dp[0][2]+dp[2][3]+1×1×5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         = max(0+15+15, 3+0+5) = 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>...最终 dp[0][5] = 167</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>区间 DP</th>\n<th>记忆化递归</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n³)</td>\n<td>O(n³)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 区间数为 O(n²)，每个区间枚举分割点 O(n)，总计 O(n³)。n ≤ 300 时约 2700 万次操作，需要常数因子够小才能通过。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> DP 表格为 (n+2) × (n+2) 的二维数组，O(n²)。</p>\n<p><strong>区间 DP 的通用范式：</strong> 本题体现了区间 DP 的标准模板——枚举区间长度、枚举区间起点、枚举分割点。这个三重循环结构是区间 DP 的核心骨架，掌握后可以迁移到合并石堆、最优三角剖分、矩阵链乘法等同类问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 312 戳气球","id":"leetcode-312-戳气球"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 188 买卖股票的最佳时机 IV","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-dp-advanced/lc0188-best-time-to-buy-sell-stock-iv"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 37 解数独","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-backtracking-string/lc0037-sudoku-solver"}}